OL,3,GNEWSADocklands waterfront park and
OL,4,Ahomes plan submitted
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlans for nearly 1,500 homes and a new
OL,7,Fwaterfront park in east London have
OL,8,Fbeen submitted by developers.
OL,10,FThe developer, Arada, has submitted the
OL,11,Fproposals to Newham Council as part of
OL,12,FThameside West, a major regeneration
OL,13,Fproject at the Royal Docks.
OL,15,FSpanning over 47 acres, the wider
OL,16,Fmasterplan has an estimated total value
OL,17,Fof #2.5bn upon completion, according to
OL,18,Fthe developer, with the potential to
OL,19,Fdeliver at least 5,000 homes.
OL,23,APub: 28-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,326,320,200,140,0,100
