OL,3,GNEWSADocklands waterfront park and
OL,4,Ahomes plan submitted
OL,5,
OL,6,FBuilding on existing hybrid planning
OL,7,Fpermission, the newly submitted
OL,8,Fapplications cover the first stage of
OL,9,Fthe project, made up of six buildings
OL,10,Fcontaining the new homes.
